WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.210
A triple is not your 1RM.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:07.868
Hit a heavy double, triple, four or five? Pick the lift and the weight. Log it with its reps.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:15.531
It is saved as a 3RM. Your 1RM never changes. Your percentages stay true in every program.

00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:19.822
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
